PLACEHOLDER FILE - This is not a valid .mind file

To create a valid poster.mind file:

1. Install MindAR CLI tools:
   npm install -g @mindar/mindar-cli

2. Compile your target image:
   mindar-image-target ./poster.png

3. This will generate poster.mind in the same directory

4. Move the generated poster.mind to ./assets/poster.mind

Alternatively, use the MindAR web compiler:
https://mind-ar.github.io/mind-ar-js-doc/tools/compile

